:name: F103 Blink + UART1
:description: 闪灯 + printf 走串口。showAnalyzer 开串口窗,GUI 里实时看输出;无头模式直接打到终端

using sysbus
mach create
$plf?=$ORIGIN/platform/blue_pill.repl
machine LoadPlatformDescription $plf

$bin?=$ORIGIN/build/blink_uart.elf

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart1

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

start
